# A WebKit tab (a DRM service, ProtectedMediaSites) keeps its back and forward list across a
# relaunch too, from WKWebView's own interactionState (GitHub #273).
# promise: #273
budget rss=900 stalls50=40
pace 0.5

cra://open?url=${WEBKIT}/page.html?n=wk1
expect-log loaded localhost \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"location.href='${WEBKIT}/page.html?n=wk2'","userGesture":true}
wait 2
cra://debug?back=before
expect-log back before: selected=\S+n=wk2 back=1 today=1$

relaunch
expect-log opens with 2 pages of history
wait 1.5
cra://debug?back=relaunched
expect-log back relaunched: selected=\S+n=wk2 back=1 today=1$
cra://action/goBack
wait 1.5
cra://debug?back=history
expect-log back history: selected=\S+n=wk1 back=0 today=1$
